    "text": "Another thing we might make use of is the ejira package, which we could adapt to Platform",
    "since": "2026-11-10T16:41:48Z"
   },
   {
    "act": "claude-13-turn-210-f-s9-0",
    "kind": "propose",
    "text": "One idea: what about developing Mojira as a code-server-native browser rather than an Emacs browser?",
    "since": "2026-11-10T16:41:48Z"
   },
   {
    "act": "claude-13-turn-210-r-1",
    "kind": "propose",
    "text": "(minimal route, two options)\n1. **Claude Code panel in code-server.** I install Claude Code's VS Code extension into yo\u2026",
    "since": "2026-11-10T16:43:03Z"
   },
   {
    "act": "claude-13-turn-211-f-s3-0",
    "kind": "propose",
    "text": "Then we could add a little sub-prompt relay thing so that I could type things like \"@mojira I'd like to visualise this \u2026",
    "since": "2026-11-10T16:54:30Z"
   },
   {
    "act": "claude-13-turn-211-f-s3-1",
    "kind": "propose",
    "text": "maybe we could even extend xiaoxiang-insert-mark with another sigil that stands for \"send relay this turn to the Mojira\u2026",
    "since": "2026-11-10T16:54:30Z"
   },
   {
    "act": "claude-13-turn-211-r-2",
    "kind": "propose",
    "text": "(the relay, next) Here's how `@mojira` could work:\n1. **A new mark in `xiaoxiang-insert-mark`**, meaning \"relay this to\u2026",
    "since": "2026-11-10T16:56:23Z"
   },
   {
    "act": "claude-13-turn-213-r-2",
    "kind": "ask-action",
    "text": "(one action) `systemctl --user restart code-server` would make the server rescan its extensions. Your browser tab recon\u2026",
    "since": "2026-11-10T16:59:35Z"
   },
   {
    "act": "claude-13-turn-214-f-s1-0",
    "kind": "ask-action",
    "text": "Let's add \u32a1 under OTHER in xiaoxiang-insert-mark, you could bind it to <comma> \u2014",
    "since": "2026-11-10T17:06:08Z"
   },
   {
    "act": "claude-13-turn-214-f-s3-0",
    "kind": "propose",
    "text": "The refactoring might be MOJIRA ASK: <subprompt contents> QUOTED BACKGROUND CONTEXT: <other prompt details>",
    "since": "2026-11-10T17:06:08Z"
   },
   {
    "act": "claude-13-turn-215-r-2",
    "kind": "ask-action",
    "text": "(try this) In the code-server tab, look for **Restricted Mode** at the left end of the status bar, or a banner at the t\u2026",
    "since": "2026-11-10T17:10:38Z"
   },
   {
    "act": "claude-13-turn-216-f-s1-0",
    "kind": "report-problem",
    "text": "OK it is loaded and I opened a dialogue with an opus agent there but that agent is not claude-cs \u2014",
